<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-24 md:py-36 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">

    <div class="max-w-5xl mb-28">
      <span class="block uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-8">
        Journal
      </span>

      <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl md:text-[96px] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.05em] mb-8">
        Notes from building slower technology.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl">
        Essays, updates, experiments, and reflections on intentional living, software, learning, and independent creation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-20">

      <article class="border-t border-outline-variant pt-10">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">

          <div class="lg:col-span-3">
            <span class="text-label-md uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-surface-variant">
              May 2026
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-9">
            <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-4">
              Why most productivity software feels exhausting
            </h2>

            <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-8 max-w-3xl">
              Modern software is optimized for stimulation instead of sustainability.
              We explore why calm interfaces may produce deeper long-term growth.
            </p>

            <a href="#" class="text-primary">
              Read Essay →
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="border-t border-outline-variant pt-10">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">

          <div class="lg:col-span-3">
            <span class="text-label-md uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-surface-variant">
              April 2026
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-9">
            <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-4">
              Designing Goal Grower around natural systems
            </h2>

            <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-8 max-w-3xl">
              Goal Grower was inspired by gardens, ecosystems, and long-term cultivation instead of streaks and urgency.
            </p>

            <a href="#" class="text-primary">
              Read Essay →
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="border-t border-outline-variant pt-10">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">

          <div class="lg:col-span-3">
            <span class="text-label-md uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-surface-variant">
              March 2026
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-9">
            <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-4">
              The future of intentional hardware
            </h2>

            <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-8 max-w-3xl">
              Why physical tools still matter in a digital age and how hardware can support healthier relationships with technology.
            </p>

            <a href="#" class="text-primary">
              Read Essay →
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-32 bg-surface-container-low">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">

    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between gap-16 items-start">

      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="block uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">
          Subscribe
        </span>

        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[64px] leading-tight mb-8">
          Occasional writing for intentional minds.
        </h2>

        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
          New essays, product updates, experiments, and reflections delivered slowly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full max-w-xl">
        <div class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl p-3 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3">
          <input
            type="email"
            placeholder="your@email.com"
            class="flex-1 bg-transparent px-6 py-4 outline-none"
          >

          <button class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-xl">
            Subscribe
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

